  "tier": "told-once",
  "plain": "In 1948, in Hart Canyon near Aztec, New Mexico, a man named Doug Noland is said to have put his eye to a punctured porthole on a crashed saucer and seen two small figures slumped over a control panel. Michels tells this himself in a 2026 episode, adding that Noland \"was specific about that hole for the rest of his life\"; Noland was with another man, Bill Ferguson, when they found the craft. It is part of a larger story of a crash near Aztec that, if true, would mean alien bodies were recovered there."
